DOCUMENT- Indian Legal RAG Assistant 
 
The Indian Legal RAG Assistant is a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) system built 
using: 
 Streamlit – UI Layer 
 Snowflake Snowpark – Data Access Layer 
 Snowflake Cortex – AI & Embedding Engine 
 Vector Similarity Search – Retrieval Layer 
 
 
User Question 
      ↓ 
Streamlit UI 
      ↓ 
Snowflake Snowpark 
      ↓ 
Embedding Generation (Cortex) 
      ↓ 
Vector Similarity Search 
      ↓ 
Context Building (Truncated) 
      ↓ 
Cortex COMPLETE (LLM) 
      ↓ 
Grounded Legal Answer 
 
 
 
Core Features 
Tool Calling RAG 
The system retrieves relevant statutory sections before calling the LLM. 
